      "writtenOn": "2024-02-28T15:07:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you for your comments. I had to redesign the fix, because in this moment we do not know exactly if perr is audio source or audio sink. Hence I am doing service discovery for audio sink and audio source and based on that information I trigger btif_av_sink_dispatch_sm_event and btif_av_source_dispatch_sm_event respectively. \nThis introduces a greater delay between avrcp connect and a2dp connect, but I don\u0027t think that would be a problem. Let me know what do you think",
